@startuml 02-indexing-pipeline
title Background — Indexing pipeline po DocumentUploadedEvent

participant "Event Publication\nRegistry (Modulith)" as Reg
participant "DocumentUploadedEvent\nListener" as L
participant "IndexingService" as IS
participant "FileRetriever" as FR
participant "TextExtractor\n(Apache Tika)" as TIKA
participant "TextChunker" as CH
participant "EmbeddingProvider\n(OpenAI)" as EP
participant "ChunkStore\n(PgVector adapter)" as CS
participant "DocumentStatusUpdater" as DSU
database "PostgreSQL\n+ pgvector" as DB

note over Reg #LightBlue: Po commicie poprzedniej tx\nModulith odpala listenery\nz tabeli event_publication

Reg -> L: onDocumentUploaded(event)
activate L
note over L: @ApplicationModuleListener\n@Async — leci na osobnym wątku\n(TenantAwareTaskDecorator\nkopiuje TenantContext + MDC)

L -> IS: index(documentId)
activate IS

IS -> DB: SELECT documents\nWHERE id = ?
note over IS #LightBlue: 3-warstwowa idempotency:\n1. status check\n2. usuń stare chunki\n3. atomowa transition\nPENDING → PROCESSING

IS -> IS: markAsProcessing(id)
IS -> DB: UPDATE documents\nSET status=PROCESSING

IS -> FR: retrieve(storedFileId)
FR -> DB: SELECT stored_files
FR --> IS: byte[] content

IS -> TIKA: extract(bytes, mimeType)
note over TIKA: Tika rozpoznaje PDF/DOCX/MD/TXT\nzwraca plain text + metadata

TIKA --> IS: plainText (np. 12 KB)

IS -> CH: chunk(text, chunkSize=500, overlap=50)
note over CH: Sliding window:\n500 znaków na chunk,\n50 znaków overlap\n→ N chunków

CH --> IS: List<TextChunk>

loop dla każdego chunka
  IS -> EP: embed(chunk.text)
  EP -> EP: HTTPS POST\napi.openai.com/embeddings
  note over EP #LightYellow: Model:\ntext-embedding-3-small\n1536 dim, batch=1 dla MVP\nKoszt: ~$0.00002 / 1K tokens
  EP --> IS: float[1536]
end

IS -> CS: storeAll(chunks)
activate CS
CS -> DB: INSERT INTO chunks\n(id, tenant_id, document_id,\nchunk_index, content, embedding,\nmetadata)
note over DB #LightBlue: HNSW index na embedding\nautomatycznie zaktualizowany
CS --> IS: void
deactivate CS

IS -> IS: indexing job COMPLETED\n(chunks_created=N, duration_ms=X)
IS -> DB: INSERT indexing_jobs

IS -> Reg: publish IndexingCompletedEvent
Reg -> DB: INSERT event_publication

deactivate IS

note over Reg #LightBlue: Drugi event w łańcuchu

Reg -> DSU: onIndexingCompleted(event)
activate DSU
DSU -> DB: UPDATE documents\nSET status=READY,\n    indexed_at=NOW()
deactivate DSU

note over DB #LightBlue: outbox cleanup:\noba eventy mają\ncompletion_date != NULL

deactivate L

note over IS #LightPink: Jeśli błąd (Tika exception,\nOpenAI 5xx, timeout):\n→ markAsFailed(error)\n→ status=FAILED\n→ chunk usuwane

@enduml
